{
 "format": 1,
 "kind": "sweepercad-asset",
 "name": "Potted plant",
 "notes": "A potted plant. Each leaf is one sweep: a thin V-section profile with a midrib (the V opens upward: profile x is up, profile y is across), along a curved midrib line, with the leaf's own outline as the scale graph and a little twist. The pot is a circle swept up with its silhouette as the scale graph, hollowed by a second sweep, with a rolled rim on a closed circular spine. Drag a midrib to move a leaf.",
